<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P rates Nat Power A$ notes A, A-1.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P rates Nat Power A$ notes A, A-1.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said it assigned its A long-term rating to National Power Plc's A$400 million 10-year notes and its A-1 short term rating to National Power's A$500 million commercial paper programme.</p>
</text>
